OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stabbed friend in beer
OL,4,Agarden jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stabbed a friend in a beer
OL,7,Fgarden following an argument over money
OL,8,Fhas been jailed.
OL,10,FGraham Butterworth, 49, attacked the
OL,11,Fman at The Manvers Arms, in Main Road,
OL,12,FRadcliffe-on-Trent, in the early
OL,13,Fevening of 31 May, Nottinghamshire
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FThe victim was placed in an induced
OL,17,Fcoma, officers said, spending almost
OL,18,Ffour weeks in hospital and risked a leg
OL,19,Famputation due to a damaged artery.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
