OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stabbed friend in beer
OL,4,Agarden jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FButterworth, of Queens Road,
OL,7,FRadcliffe-on-Trent, who had earlier
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty to wounding with intent
OL,9,Fand possession of a knife in a public
OL,10,Fplace, was jailed for 12 years at
OL,11,FNottingham Crown Court on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
